-- Creates a FREE, exam-specific module and imports all 55 sets as mock_exam:
--   • Sets 1–51  → topic "मोडेल सेट"
--   • Sets 52–55 → topic "विगतका प्रश्नपत्र" (exam_year + paper_ref + past-paper tag)
-- Questions carry is_verified per-question (false where an unresolved verify
-- flag remains; 73 such questions across the book).
