      (v_set_id, 36, E'What is the primary function of an operating system?', E'Manage hardware', E'Compile programs', E'Connect to the internet', E'Perform calculations', 'A', E'Manage hardware – The OS manages computer resources like CPU, memory, and storage.\nCompile programs – A function of a compiler, not an OS.\nConnect to the internet – Not the primary function of an OS.\nPerform calculations – Calculations are done by software or processors, not the OS itself.', 'english', true, NULL, NULL),
